# /load ~/.aider/commands/plan.cmds — produce a plan only, no edits (architect-grade model in ask mode).
/chat-mode ask
/model arch
/ask Act as the planner from CONVENTIONS.md. Produce the smallest executable plan (≤ 40 lines) using the sections: Objective, Context, Assumptions, Plan (files per step), Decisions (REQUIRED vs OPTIONAL), Risks, Specialist, Verification (exact commands), Escalate if. Do not edit files. Then switch back with /model dev before implementing.
